I wrote no DB-backed tests, so none were left unrun. No docker was run. I ran rustfmt only on my two new execution-core test files (CI runs cargo fmt --all -- --check); the gateway hunk was wrapped by hand to the rustfmt-clean form, and my zdr-contract-sync.test.sh additions are plain shell with no rustfmt involved.

